{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42738","headline":"梦归故园 一 · 刘兼","name":"梦归故园 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桐叶飞霜落井栏，菱花藏雪助衰颜。\n夜窗飒飒摇寒竹，秋枕迢迢梦故山。\n临水钓舟横荻岸，隔溪禅侣啓柴关。\n觉来依旧三更月，离绪乡心起万端。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42738.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42738","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}